{
  "id": "p11",
  "title": "The Cinema Repair Day",
  "titleZh": "电影院修缮日",
  "topic": "社区",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My village will repair the old town hall this morning.",
        "zh": "今天早上，我们村子要修缮那座老镇政厅。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A simple notice on the wooden window says work starts soon.",
        "zh": "木窗上贴着一张简单的告示，说工作很快就开始。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Seven members of our village team meet beside the side door.",
        "zh": "我们村队的七名成员在侧门旁集合。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A qualified carpenter explains the detailed plan again.",
        "zh": "一位有资格的木匠又讲了一遍详细的计划。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We consider every action before we touch the heavy furniture.",
        "zh": "我们每做一个动作之前都先考虑，然后才去搬那些沉重的家具。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My good friend wants a small part in this work.",
        "zh": "我的好朋友想在这件工作里出一小份力。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her name appears at the top of the list.",
        "zh": "她的名字出现在名单的最上面。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A retired soldier brings a long pipe and a warm coat.",
        "zh": "一位退役士兵带来一根长管子和一件暖和的外套。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A young prisoner joins us too, and nobody seems to mind.",
        "zh": "一个年轻的囚犯也加入我们，似乎没有人介意。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His behaviour is calm, and his effort is clear.",
        "zh": "他的举止平静，他的努力也显而易见。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A high wooden gate opens to the wide, dusty yard.",
        "zh": "一扇高高的木门通向宽阔多尘的院子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a nurse arrives with hot coffee for us.",
        "zh": "这时一位护士带着热咖啡来到我们这儿。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My mother packs orange drinks and a small plate for us.",
        "zh": "我母亲为我们装好橙汁和一小盘食物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A couple from the next street brings a small gift.",
        "zh": "隔壁街的一对夫妇带来一件小小的礼物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later, a tall clock and a photo bring back old times.",
        "zh": "后来，一座高钟和一张照片唤起了旧日时光。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The museum sends a framed picture for our small discussion.",
        "zh": "博物馆为我们的简短讨论寄来一幅带框的画。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our successful holiday project wins a city prize this year.",
        "zh": "我们成功的假日项目今年赢得了市里的一个奖项。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A sport festival follows next week at the riverside park.",
        "zh": "下周在河畔公园还有一场体育节。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Five hundred people may come, and sixty will bring food.",
        "zh": "可能会有五百人来，六十人会带食物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My father warns us about the wet floor near the passage.",
        "zh": "父亲提醒我们小心通道附近的湿地。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A small cap hangs there, and nothing else looks new.",
        "zh": "那里挂着一顶小帽子，别的地方看起来都不新。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We spread the news, and every helper gets a chance.",
        "zh": "我们把这个消息传开，每个帮手都得到一次机会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The children play outside and enjoy the warm, bright afternoon.",
        "zh": "孩子们在外面玩耍，享受着温暖明亮的下午。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then we make a short speech early in the afternoon.",
        "zh": "然后，我们在下午早些时候做了一个简短的讲话。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The boys' small fight ends fast, and a lot of us laugh.",
        "zh": "男孩们的小打斗很快结束，我们很多人都笑了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The cool earth under the floor keeps the air excellent.",
        "zh": "地板下凉爽的泥土让空气保持得非常好。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The cinema gets a new steel frame above the front door.",
        "zh": "电影院在正门上方装上了新的钢架。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We write a short record, and we share bread and cheese.",
        "zh": "我们写下简短的记录，一起分面包和奶酪。"
      }
    ]
  ],
